  "prefLabel": "Env-WMC 205.02 Supplemental Materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 205.02 Supplemental Materials. Memoranda, briefs, and other written materials designed to supplement a notice of appeal shall be filed in accordance with Env-WMC 203.09(b) and shall be served in accordance with Env-WMC 204.09 at least 10 business days prior to the scheduled hearing on the appeal.\n\nSource. #8031, eff 1-24-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wmc200.html"
